sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant F as FrmProducts
    participant P as Product
    participant R as ProductDAL<br/>(IRepository#lt;Product#gt;)
    participant DB as SQL Server

    U->>F: Fill in fields, click ADD
    F->>F: decimal.Parse / int.Parse
    F->>P: new Product(name, category, price, qty, reorder, supplier)
    P->>P: Property setters validate values
    F->>R: Add(product)
    R->>P: Validate()
    R->>DB: EXEC sp_AddProduct @ProductName, @UnitPrice, ...
    DB-->>R: 1 row affected
    R-->>F: true
    F->>R: GetAll()
    R->>DB: EXEC sp_GetAllProducts
    DB-->>R: Rows
    R-->>F: List of Product objects
    F-->>U: "Product added successfully." + refreshed grid

    Note over F,P: Errors are caught separately in FrmProducts:<br/>FormatException (e.g. "abc" as price),<br/>ValidationException (e.g. negative price),<br/>SqlException (database problem)
